cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GeoInvLab3D in your research, please cite this software."
title: "GeoInvLab3D: An Open-Source Python Framework for Three-Dimensional Geophysical Modeling and Inversion"
type: software
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-11-19

authors:
  - family-names: "BOUKAR"
    given-names: "ABDELGHAFOUR"

abstract: >
  GeoInvLab3D is an open-source Python framework for three-dimensional
  geophysical forward modeling and inversion. It provides a modular
  architecture supporting gravity, magnetic, and magnetotelluric methods,
  together with numerical inversion tools, three-dimensional visualization,
  and a graphical user interface.

keywords:
  - Geophysics
  - Gravity
  - Magnetic modeling
  - Magnetotellurics
  - Three-dimensional modeling
  - Geophysical inversion
  - Python
  - Open-source software

license: MIT

repository-code: "https://github.com/BoukarAbdelghafour/GeoInvLab3D"

url: "https://github.com/BoukarAbdelghafour/GeoInvLab3D"
